{%- comment -%}
PFC Trends: mirrors the web home page's Trends band. Payload (trmnl_home.trends_payload):
title, date, horizon, rows[] {name, status, why}. `status` is the light word
(RED / YELLOW / GREEN / NO DATA), printed as text, never as a symbol. RED gets a
filled label so it reads first; the rest are outlined.

Sparse by nature (5 rows), so the full view is poster-sized.
E-ink rules: no emoji, no inline styles; framework classes only.
{%- endcomment -%}
